idah is a self contained \"Community\" with a host of facilities, amenities and other pluses such as Banks, Tesco Hypermarket, clinics, beauty saloons, food street & restaurants, cafes, education centers, nearby colleges and many mores. Location wise, it is strategically located within 15 minutes walking distance Tesco Extra. There are two recreational parks located nearby, namely Taman Tasik Permaisuri and Pudu Ulu Park. Walking distance to Hospital Universiti Kebangsaan Malaysia located only within a kilometres from the condominium.In term of accessibility, one can utilize either Jalan Loke Yew or Cheras to the city centre. Also, one can head towards Jalan Cheras and access Cheras-Kajang Highway to reach the rest of Cheras neighborhoods, Kajang and Seremban. Plus, you can utilize East-West Highway (Lebuhraya Hubungan Timur-Barat) (access via Bandar Tun Razak) to reach Mid Valley City and its surrounding area. KESAS highway is not very far as well, you can utilize it to reach Subang, Shah Alam and Klang. You can use the Middle Ring Road 2 (MRR2) to go to Ampang, Ulu Klang, or Damansara via DUKE Highway.\n\n### Property Details\n\n* Name: Prima Midah Heights\n* Address: Jalan Midah 8, Taman Midah, Cheras, 56000 Kuala Lumpur\n* Developer: Midah Heights Sdn Bhd (a subsidiary of UOA Group)\n* Completion Date: 2005\n* Type: Condominium\n* Tenure: Freehold\n* No. of Units: 480\n* Penthouse: 21 (6 rooms & 4 baths)\n* Standard: 459 (4 rooms & 2 baths)\n* No. of Storey\n* Block A: 25 (181 units)\n* Block B: 24 (173 units)\n* Block C: 17 (126 units)\n* Maintenance Fee: RM0.20 psf\n* Built-up: 1,460 - 2,915 sf\n* Subsale Price:\n* Rental:\n\n### 产业资讯一览\n\n* 名称：Prima Midah Heights\n* 地址：Jalan Midah 8, Taman Midah, Cheras, 56000 Kuala Lumpur\n* 发展商：Midah Heights Sdn Bhd (UOA Group子公司)\n* 竣工日期：2005年\n* 类型：公寓\n* 产权：租赁地契\n* 单位数目：480\n* 阁楼：21 (6卧室 & 4 浴室)\n* 标准型：459 (4 卧室 & 2 浴室)\n* 楼层数目\n* A座：25 (181个单位)\n* B座：24 (173个单位)\n* C座： 17 (126 个单位)\n* 管理费：RM0.20 psf\n* 实用面积：1,460 - 2,915 sf\n* 转售价：RM455,000-RM1,380,000\n* 租金：RM1,350-RM3,800\n\n### 设备\n\n* 游泳池\n* 浅水池\n* 健身房\n* 烧烤区\n* 羽球场\n* 多功能礼堂\n* 儿童游乐场\n* 慢跑步道\n* 运动站（Exercise station）\n* ASTRO中央装置电缆\n\n### Market Trends\n\n#### Latest transaction in Prima Midah Heights, Taman Midah\n\nSPA Date  | Address  | Size  | Price\n--- | --- | --- | ---\n02/10/2017  | X-X-X, JALAN MIDAH X  | 1485 ft^{2}  | 650000\n02/10/2017  | X-X-X, JALAN MIDAH X  | 1485 ft^{2}  | 630000\n16/09/2017  | X-XA-X, JALAN MIDAH X  | 1485 ft^{2}  | 635000\n25/07/2017  | X-X-X, JALAN MIDAH X  | 1475 ft^{2}  | 628000\n22/06/2017  | X-XA-X, JALAN MIDAH X  | 1485 ft^{2}  | 680000\n\n### 分析\n\nPrima Midah Heights共有3栋精心设计的公寓建筑物，为住户提供现代化的高楼居住体验。Prima Midah Heights是蕉赖其中一个管理最佳的公寓，目前由高效的JMB（管理公司）来管理。兴建中的Cheras MRT轻快铁站就建在Jalan Cheras的Taman Midah入口处，距离公寓只需步行15分钟。此公寓的最大卖点是绿意盎然的舒适景致和豪华的游泳池。健身房备有2部跑步机、健身脚踏车、步行器（ski walker）和4套锻炼器材。另外，公寓内还设有一个位于池畔的多功能礼堂，以及家庭烧烤区。保安严密，但讽刺的是，不少人却嫌过于严密的保安为他们带来麻烦，惟住户则表示对此满意，也非常喜欢如此森严的保安措施。这里的住户多数是专业人士、医生、生意人、外籍人士和公务员。--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nPrima Midah Heights untuk Untuk Dijual - RM 539,000, Jul 2026 (https://www.propertyguru.com.my/bm/senarai-hartanah/prima-midah-heights-untuk-dijual-oleh-wai-mun-501652861)\nciteturn303search6 [wordlim: 200] Published: 3 months ago; Crawled: 3 months ago; Prima Midah Heights in Cheras is a freehold condominium standing tall at Jalan Midah 8, Taman Midah, present within the vicinity of Cheras.It has been developed under the guidance of Midah Heights Sdn Bhd which is subsidiary of UOA Group.\n\n## Tentang hartanah ini\n\n### Prima Midah Heights, Taman Midah - Neat Unit\n\nTastefully furnished unit, well kept and ready to move in.\nCurrently tenanted.\nLocated at Block C.\nCan sell with / without Tenancy\nView to appreciate.\nContact Waimun 0*****\nContact Waimun 0*****\n\n##### Kemudahan\n\nImage: aircon-o\n\nAir conditioner\n\nImage: balcony-o\n\nBalkoni\n\nImage: asterisk-o\n\nCooker hood\n\nImage: parking-o\n\nCovered c